theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 40
text = "Task 1: Shake Hand and Get Introduced to Samuel
Tip: Approach Samuel with care and patience.

Start Slowly: You’re in Samuel’s room. Speak slowly, with sentences of 3 words or fewer. Repeat your request to him 3 times.
Avoid Agitation: If you speak too fast or use long sentences, Samuel may get upset. After two consecutive upsets without a 30-second cool-off, he could become more agitated and cry. Crying requires a 60-second cool-off.
Initiate the Handshake: Say “Let’s Handshake” 3 times slowly, then extend your hand for Samuel to shake.
Face Samuel: Speak to Samuel directly, staying within 20 degrees of his face, or he won’t respond.
Clues: If Samuel becomes agitated or cries, look for a clue icon for guidance.
Endgame Insight: If you shake his hand without saying “Let’s Handshake,” Samuel may feel overstimulated, indicated by a vibration in the controller."
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

