theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 40
text = "Task 3: Set Up Light, Temperature, and Sound for Samuel
Tip: Create a soothing environment for Samuel.

Light Control: Turn on the light within 15 seconds, or Samuel will leave the room.
Dim the Light: Samuel is sensitive to bright lights. Lower the brightness to mid-low within 30 seconds to prevent him from getting agitated and leaving.
Warmth: Samuel prefers a cozy, warm environment.
Turn on the heater within 60 seconds and set the temperature to 72–76°F. Too high or low will agitate him within 30 seconds.
Watch for blue or yellow indicators around Samuel to show if he’s uncomfortable with the temperature.
Endgame Insight: At the end, a bright display and a yellow/blue room shade will reflect Samuel’s perception if the lighting or temperature was unsuitable."
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

