theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 40
text = "Task 5: Prepare a Glass of Juice for Samuel
Tip: Keep Samuel informed and entertained safely.

Announce the Blender: Before starting, let Samuel know you’re “starting the blender”.
Repeat this 3 times slowly, directly facing Samuel within a 20-degree angle. Otherwise, he might get upset and leave the room.
Use the Right Cup: Samuel finds glass breaking entertaining. Serve the juice in his designated plastic cup; otherwise, he’ll break it.
Endgame Insight: If the wrong cup is used, you’ll see surprised faces as Samuel views this as play. The blender sound will also be amplified to reflect how he perceives it."
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

